---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---
<Figure id="d-recovery-timeline">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-label="Account and organization recovery share one timeline: a credential made beforehand (a recovery code or an organization's recovery key) starts a recovery, which waits 72 hours during which the account's passkeys or the organization's owner can cancel it; after the delay the new passkey or the recovering account finishes it." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="330" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>
  <text x="380" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">recovery: start, 72 hours to cancel, finish</text>

  <!-- axis -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <line x1="150" y1="70" x2="730" y2="70" stroke="#444c56" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <line x1="210" y1="62" x2="210" y2="78" stroke="#8b949e" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <line x1="300" y1="62" x2="300" y2="78" stroke="#a5ff11" stroke-width="2"/>
    <line x1="600" y1="62" x2="600" y2="78" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="210" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">before</text>
    <text x="300" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5ff11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">start (at)</text>
    <text x="600" y="54" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">readyAt = at + 72 h</text>
    <rect x="300" y="84" width="300" height="20" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e" stroke-opacity=".7"/>
    <text x="450" y="98" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">pending: cancel allowed, finish refused (409 RECOVERY_NOT_READY)</text>
    <rect x="600" y="84" width="130" height="20" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-opacity=".7"/>
    <text x="665" y="98" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9">finish allowed</text>
  </g>

  <!-- account row -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:1">
    <text x="20" y="146" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">account</text>
    <text x="20" y="160" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">/auth/recovery</text>
    <rect x="150" y="128" width="120" height="44" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#58a6ff"/>
    <text x="210" y="146" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">make a code</text>
    <text x="210" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">a passkey approves</text>
    <rect x="276" y="128" width="150" height="44" rx="5" fill="#10151c" stroke="#a5ff11"/>
    <text x="351" y="146" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">begin + start</text>
    <text x="351" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">code + new passkey; code spent</text>
    <rect x="436" y="128" width="150" height="44" rx="5" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e"/>
    <text x="511" y="146" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">cancel</text>
    <text x="511" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">any passkey it still has</text>
    <rect x="600" y="128" width="140" height="44" rx="5" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950"/>
    <text x="670" y="146" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">finish: new passkey</text>
    <text x="670" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">sessions + API keys end</text>
  </g>

  <!-- org row -->
  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:2">
    <text x="20" y="214" fill="#a371f7" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">organization</text>
    <text x="20" y="228" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">/orgs/&#123;org&#125;/recovery</text>
    <rect x="150" y="196" width="120" height="44" rx="5" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a371f7"/>
    <text x="210" y="214" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">set a key</text>
    <text x="210" y="228" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">owner; seed offline</text>
    <rect x="276" y="196" width="150" height="44" rx="5" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a5ff11"/>
    <text x="351" y="214" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">start</text>
    <text x="351" y="228" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">seed signs org+account</text>
    <rect x="436" y="196" width="150" height="44" rx="5" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e"/>
    <text x="511" y="214" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">cancel / rotate key</text>
    <text x="511" y="228" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">the owner's passkey</text>
    <rect x="600" y="196" width="140" height="44" rx="5" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950"/>
    <text x="670" y="214" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">finish: new owner</text>
    <text x="670" y="228" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">old owners leave the org</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:3">
    <text x="380" y="276" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">times are the commands' own `at` (the proposing node's clock, replicated), never apply time</text>
    <text x="380" y="292" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">one pending recovery at a time (409 RECOVERY_PENDING) · every proof spent once (used_proofs)</text>
    <text x="380" y="308" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">members see recovery.pending; the account's devices see recoveryPending in /auth/me</text>
  </g>
</svg>
</Figure>
